### Payments Methods - crear (ADMIN)
POST {{HOST}}/payments-methods/add
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MercadoPago",
  "isActive": true
}

### Payments Methods - listar (PUBLIC)
GET {{HOST}}/payments-methods

### Payments Methods - ver uno (PUBLIC)
GET {{HOST}}/payments-methods/1

### Payments Methods - actualizar (ADMIN)
PUT {{HOST}}/payments-methods/4
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mercado Pago",
  "isActive": true
}

### Payments Methods - eliminar (ADMIN)
DELETE {{HOST}}/payments-methods/1
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}

### Crear Payment (CLIENT)
POST {{HOST}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 6,
  "userId": 8,
  "amount": 123.45,
  "methodId": 1
}

### Listar Payments (CLIENT, VENDOR, ADMIN)
GET {{HOST}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}

### Ver Payment por id (CLIENT, ADMIN)
GET {{HOST}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}

### Actualizar Payment (CLIENT, ADMIN)
PATCH {{HOST}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 150.01,
  "methodId": 2
}

### Eliminar Payment (ADMIN)
DELETE {{HOST}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}

###

PATCH {{HOST}}/payments/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "success": true
}

### Notas:
# - Reemplaza {{JWT}} por un token válido (obtenido en /auth/login).
# - Ajusta los IDs (orderId, userId, methodId, 1) a valores existentes en tu BD.
# - Los endpoints con Roles require que el JWT contenga el role apropiado (ADMIN/CLIENT/VENDOR).
# - Si necesitas, puedo añadir un request de /auth/login aquí para obtener el token desde el mismo archivo.
